linux-redmi-marble (7.2.8+marble8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * postinst: require the ESP to be mounted at /boot/efi. A missing mount
    point or an unmounted ESP now fails configuration with instructions to
    mount it and rerun dpkg --configure -a, instead of silently skipping the
    boot payload sync.
  * postinst: write /extlinux/extlinux.conf only on the initial installation
    (empty $2). Upgrades continue to refresh /marble/vmlinuz and the DTB but
    preserve the existing boot configuration.

